#: src/modes/xorg/xorgLogMode.cpp:47
msgid "Display the X.org log."
msgstr "Amosar el rexistru de X.org."

#: src/modes/xorg/xorgLogMode.cpp:48
msgid ""
"Displays the X.org log in the current tab. X.org is the service which "
"displays on screen your desktop and manage your graphical hardware. See this "
"log if you want to know why you do not have 3D accelerations or why your "
"input device is not recognized."
msgstr ""
"Amuesa'l rexistru de X.org na llingüeta actual. X.org ye'l serviciu "
"qu'amuesa el to escritoriu na pantalla, y que xestiona el to hardware "
"gráficu. Mira esti rexistru si quies saber por qué nun tien aceleración 3D o "
"por qué nun se reconoz el to preséu d'entrada."

